namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamMenuAnchor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor
    src   "A place a menu opens from, and the thing that puts it away again.\n\nUMG's MenuAnchor in the DreamGUI idiom. The menu is a popup on UDreamUIPopupLayer's per-player\nstack, as the dropdown's list is: lifted to the screen root so no ancestor clips it or counts it in\nits layout, closed by a press anywhere else (bCloseOnClickOutside), by Back, and by this anchor\ngoing away or out of sight; and a menu opened from inside an open menu is its child, closed with\nit. Focus that went into the menu comes back to whatever had it when it opened. A press elsewhere\nthat closes the menu then goes on to what it landed on, as Slate's menu stack lets it, unless the\nproject's UDreamGUISettings::bMenusConsumeOutsideClick keeps it.\n\nTWO WAYS TO SAY WHAT THE MENU IS, and they are alternatives:\n\n  - fill the `Menu` slot -- `Native.MenuAnchor { ... }` in .dui, or a designer drop -- and the\n    content is authored in place, which is what a small menu wants;\n  - or set MenuClass, and an instance of it is made the first time the menu opens and kept, which\n    is what a menu shared between several anchors wants. Instancing a user widget needs a world,\n    so with none this quietly stays an empty menu rather than half of one.\n\nWith both, the SLOT wins: content somebody put there is content they meant to see.\n\nWHERE IT OPENS is FDreamMenuAnchorStyle::Placement, which is a style rather than a widget property\non purpose -- a project wants every menu in it to open the same way, and the override bits still\nlet one instance disagree.\n\nTHE SIZE IS STATED, NOT MEASURED. MenuSize is an authored number for the reason the dropdown's\nlist height is: a popup is arranged by nobody until it is on screen, so measuring it would mean\nopening it invisibly for a frame first. A menu whose content states its own size can say so by\nleaving MenuSize at zero on that axis, which hands the axis back to the content."
    text  "菜单由此打开，也由此收起。\n\nDreamGUI风格下的UMG MenuAnchor。菜单是UDreamUIPopupLayer每玩家\n堆栈上的弹出层，与下拉列表相同：被提升到屏幕根节点，因此没有祖先会裁剪它，也不会将其计入\n自己的布局；在别处按下（bCloseOnClickOutside）、按返回键、以及此锚点\n消失或离开视野时关闭；在已打开的菜单内部打开的菜单是它的子项，随它一同\n关闭。进入菜单的焦点会回到菜单打开时持有它的对象。关闭菜单的别处\n按下随后会继续传递到它落到的位置，如同Slate的菜单堆栈所允许的那样，除非\n项目的UDreamGUISettings::bMenusConsumeOutsideClick将其保留。\n\n说明菜单内容有两种方式，二者互斥：\n\n  - 填充`Menu`槽——在.dui中写`Native.MenuAnchor { ... }`，或在设计器中拖入——内容\n    就地编写，这正是小菜单所需要的；\n  - 或设置MenuClass，菜单首次打开时会创建它的一个实例并保留，这\n    正是多个锚点共用的菜单所需要的。实例化用户控件需要一个世界，\n    因此没有世界时它会静默地保持为空菜单，而不是半个菜单。\n\n两者都有时，槽优先：有人放在那里的内容就是他们想看到的内容。\n\n打开位置由FDreamMenuAnchorStyle::Placement决定，它刻意做成样式而非控件\n属性——项目希望其中每个菜单都以相同方式打开，而覆盖位仍\n允许单个实例有所不同。\n\n尺寸是声明的，不是测量的。MenuSize是一个编写好的数值，原因与下拉列表的\n高度相同：弹出层在出现在屏幕上之前不会被任何人排布，因此测量它意味着先\n隐形地打开一帧。内容自带尺寸的菜单可以在该轴上将MenuSize留为0来表明这一点，\n从而把该轴交还给内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:bCloseOnClickOutside {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:bCloseOnClickOutside
    src   "Whether a press anywhere else closes the menu. Off makes it the caller's job. The press then goes on to whatever\nit landed on, as Slate's menu stack lets it, unless the project's UDreamGUISettings::bMenusConsumeOutsideClick\nkeeps it."
    text  "在别处按下是否关闭菜单。关闭此项后，这一工作由调用方负责。该次按下随后会继续传递到\n它落到的位置，如同Slate的菜单堆栈所允许的那样，除非项目的UDreamGUISettings::bMenusConsumeOutsideClick\n将其保留。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:bFitInWindow {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:bFitInWindow
    src   "Keep the open menu inside the screen -- UMG's bFitInWindow, and the same arithmetic the panel\nspelling of this anchor uses (UDreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor::FitMenuInWindow, called here\nrather than copied, so a menu lands in the same place whichever road opened it).\n\nOFF by default, where UMG's and the panel's are on: a menu near a screen edge currently lands\nwhere the placement put it, and turning the clamp on for every existing anchor would move\nmenus that somebody positioned on purpose. New work should turn it on.\n\n\"The window\" is the root widget of the hierarchy, which is the rect everything is laid out\ninside -- the nearest thing here to a Slate window."
    text  "让打开的菜单保持在屏幕内——即UMG的bFitInWindow，使用与此锚点的面板\n版本相同的算法（UDreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor::FitMenuInWindow，此处是调用\n而非复制，因此无论从哪条路径打开，菜单都会落在相同的位置）。\n\n默认关闭，而UMG的和面板的该项默认开启：靠近屏幕边缘的菜单目前会落在\n放置方式所指定的地方，而对所有现有锚点开启此钳制会移动\n有人刻意摆好的菜单。新做的内容应将其开启。\n\n“窗口”是层级中的根控件，即所有内容都在其中排布的\n矩形——此处最接近Slate窗口的东西。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:bPopupElevated {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:bPopupElevated
    src   "Set while the popup is up on the popup layer; the popup's resting geometry must not be written while it is."
    text  "弹出层在弹出层上显示期间置位；在此期间不得写入弹出层的静止几何信息。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:Close {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:Close
    src   "Take it off screen and hand it home: any menu opened from inside it first, then every player's\nfocus that was in it back where it was when the menu opened -- unless the player has moved it\nelsewhere meanwhile. A no-op while it is already closed."
    text  "将其移出屏幕并归还：先关闭在其中打开的任何菜单，然后把每个玩家留在其中的\n焦点送回菜单打开时所处的位置——除非玩家在此期间已将其移到\n别处。已经关闭时为无操作。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:FitInWindow {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:FitInWindow
    src   "Named as UMG names the call. Re-places an open menu at once."
    text  "命名与 UMG 的调用一致。立即重新放置已打开的菜单。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:GetMenuPosition {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:GetMenuPosition
    src   "Where the menu sits, in this anchor's own local space -- UMG's GetMenuPosition.\n\nThe popup's anchored position, which is the answer whether or not the popup has been lifted to\nthe screen layer: it is placed against the anchor BEFORE being lifted, and put back through the\nsame placement when it closes. Zero while there is no popup node at all."
    text  "菜单所在的位置，在此锚点自身的局部空间中——即UMG的GetMenuPosition。\n\n弹出层的锚定位置；无论弹出层是否已被提升到\n屏幕层，这一答案都成立：它在提升之前就按锚点放置，关闭时再经过相同的\n放置流程放回。完全没有弹出节点时为零。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:GetPlacement {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:GetPlacement
    src   "Where the menu opens relative to this anchor -- UMG's Placement, read from the style in EFFECT\nrather than from the field beside it, so an anchor driven by the project sheet answers the\nplacement it actually uses."
    text  "菜单相对于此锚点的打开位置——即UMG的Placement，读取的是实际生效的样式，而非旁边的\n字段，因此由项目样式表驱动的锚点回答的是它\n实际使用的放置方式。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:HasOpenSubMenus {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:HasOpenSubMenus
    src   "Whether anything inside this menu has a menu of ITS own open -- UMG's HasOpenSubMenus.\n\nThe question a menu asks before closing itself on a click elsewhere: the click may have landed\nin a submenu, which is still this menu's business. Answered by walking the menu's subtree for\nopen anchors, because a submenu here is exactly that -- another UDreamMenuAnchor inside the\ncontent -- rather than an entry on an application-wide menu stack."
    text  "此菜单内部是否有任何东西打开了自己的菜单——即UMG的HasOpenSubMenus。\n\n菜单在因别处点击而关闭自身之前会问的问题：该点击可能落在\n子菜单中，而那仍然属于此菜单的事务。通过遍历菜单子树查找已打开的\n锚点来回答，因为这里的子菜单正是如此——内容中的另一个\nUDreamMenuAnchor——而不是应用程序级菜单堆栈上的一个条目。"
    state machine
}

