DreamMenuAnchor:OnGetUserMenuContentEvent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:OnGetUserMenuContentEvent
    src   "Builds the menu's content the first time it is needed, instead of MenuClass.\n\nAsked once, when there is no menu yet and nothing authored in the hole -- not on every open.\nThe anchor keeps what it is handed and owns it from then on, exactly as it keeps an instance\nmade from MenuClass; a handler that wants different content next time changes what is inside\nthe widget it already gave, or calls SetMenuClass(nullptr) to be asked again.\n\nRanks below authored content and above MenuClass: something a host put in the hole is what a\nhost meant to see, and a delegate is a more specific answer than a class."
    text  "在首次需要时构建菜单内容，而不是使用MenuClass。\n\n仅在尚无菜单、且空位中没有任何已创作内容时询问一次——而不是每次打开都询问。\n锚点会保留交给它的内容，并从此拥有它，就像它保留由MenuClass\n创建的实例一样；若处理程序下次想要不同内容，应更改它已提供的\n控件内部的内容，或调用SetMenuClass(nullptr)以便再次被询问。\n\n优先级低于已创作内容、高于MenuClass：宿主放入空位的内容才是宿主\n希望看到的内容，而委托是比类更具体的答案。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:OnMenuOpenChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:OnMenuOpenChanged
    src   "Open and closed, as the anchor announces them. Fires after the move, never during. An open that closed again before\nOpen returned -- the focus moving into the menu ran a handler that closed it -- announces neither."
    text  "打开与关闭，由锚点宣布。在状态变化之后触发，绝不在变化过程中触发。若一次打开在\nOpen 返回前又关闭了——焦点移入菜单时运行的处理程序关闭了它——则两者都不宣布。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:Open {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:Open
    src   "Put the menu on screen, positioned by the style. A no-op while it is already open.\n\nbFocusMenu is UMG's, and it means what it says: the first navigable thing inside the menu\ntakes focus, so a pad or a keyboard can walk the menu it just opened without the player first\nhaving to find it. A menu with nothing navigable in it leaves focus where it was rather than\ndropping it somewhere arbitrary -- the same call, and the same rule, as UDreamTabView's.\n\nDefaulted, and last, so every existing Open() keeps compiling and keeps meaning what it did."
    text  "将菜单显示到屏幕上，并由样式决定其位置。菜单已打开时不执行任何操作。\n\nbFocusMenu 是 UMG 的参数，含义如其名：菜单内第一个可导航内容\n获得焦点，因此手柄或键盘可以直接浏览刚打开的菜单，而无需玩家先\n找到它。菜单内没有任何可导航内容时，焦点会留在原处，而不是\n被丢到任意位置——这与 UDreamTabView 的调用和规则相同。\n\n有默认值且位于最后，因此所有现有 Open() 仍可编译，并保持原有含义。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:PopupNode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:PopupNode
    src   "The popup root: what gets lifted to the screen, positioned and faded."
    text  "弹出根节点：被提升到屏幕、进行定位和淡入淡出的对象。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:ProvidedMenuContent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:ProvidedMenuContent
    src   "What OnGetUserMenuContentEvent handed over, kept so the handler is asked ONCE.\n\nA second field rather than reusing MenuInstance above, because a handler may hand back any\nwidget at all and MenuInstance is specifically a user widget the anchor built itself. Which of\nthe two is set is also how the anchor knows who owns what."
    text  "OnGetUserMenuContentEvent所交给的内容，保留它以确保处理程序只被询问一次。\n\n这是一个单独的字段，而不是复用上方的MenuInstance，因为处理程序可以返回任意\n控件，而MenuInstance特指锚点自己构建的用户控件。两者中设置的是哪一个，\n也是锚点判断谁拥有什么的方式。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:SetCloseOnClickOutside {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:SetCloseOnClickOutside
    src   "Decides what a click elsewhere does WHILE the menu is open, rather than only what the next open\ndoes -- a menu that started closing on outside clicks only on its second showing would be a\nswitch that appears not to work."
    text  "决定菜单打开期间在别处点击会有什么效果，而不只是决定下一次打开\n时的行为——如果菜单只在第二次显示时才开始在外部点击时关闭，那这个开关\n看起来就像没起作用。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:SetMenuClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:SetMenuClass
    src   "Which menu this anchor opens. The instance is built on first open and kept, so a class changed\nafterwards throws the old instance away rather than leaving the anchor opening the previous\nmenu forever. A change while the menu is OPEN closes it first: swapping the contents of a menu\nthe player is reading is not a thing this can do quietly."
    text  "此锚点打开哪个菜单。实例在首次打开时构建并保留，因此之后再更改类\n会丢弃旧实例，而不是让锚点一直打开之前的\n菜单。菜单处于打开状态时更改会先关闭它：替换玩家正在阅读的菜单\n内容，不是此操作能悄悄完成的事。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:SetMenuSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:SetMenuSize
    src   "Re-places an open menu at once, so the new size is not something only the next open shows."
    text  "立即重新定位已打开的菜单，因此新尺寸不会只在下次打开时才显示。"
    state machine
}

