}

DreamMenuAnchor:SetStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:SetStyle
    src   "This instance's whole look, replaced and pushed. See UDreamButton::SetStyle for the caveat."
    text  "本实例的完整外观，整体替换并推送。注意事项参见 UDreamButton::SetStyle。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:ShouldOpenDueToClick {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:ShouldOpenDueToClick
    src   "Whether a click on the anchor should open the menu -- UMG's ShouldOpenDueToClick, and the\nquestion a button wrapping an anchor has to ask before it calls Open: a click that lands while\nthe menu is already up is the click that DISMISSED it, and opening again would make a menu\nimpossible to close by clicking the thing that opened it.\n\nNo, too, for the click of the press that has just closed the menu from outside it: that press\ngoes on to what it landed on (bCloseOnClickOutside), and when that is the trigger, its click\ncomes as the press is let go -- after the close. SMenuAnchor answers it with bDismissedThisTick,\nwhich holds because SComboButton clicks on the press; a trigger here clicks on the release, so\nthe answer holds until the press that closed the menu has been let go."
    text  "点击锚点是否应打开菜单——这就是UMG的ShouldOpenDueToClick，也是\n包裹锚点的按钮在调用Open之前必须确认的问题：菜单已经打开时落下的那次点击，\n正是关闭菜单的那次点击；若此时再次打开，菜单就无法\n再通过点击打开它的那个东西来关闭。\n\n对于刚刚从菜单外部把菜单关闭的那次按下所产生的点击，答案同样为否：该按下\n会继续传给它落到的控件（bCloseOnClickOutside）；当它正是触发器时，它的点击\n在按下被松开时才到来——也就是在关闭之后。SMenuAnchor用bDismissedThisTick来回答，\n该回答之所以成立，是因为SComboButton在按下时点击；而这里的触发器在松开时点击，所以\n该回答会一直有效，直到关闭菜单的那次按下被松开。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchor:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchor:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect."
    text  "本实例自身的外观。只要StyleSource如此指定且样式表\n确实存在，项目样式表就优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，这里就是实际生效的外观。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchorGetContent__DelegateSignature {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamMenuAnchor.h#DreamMenuAnchorGetContent__DelegateSignature
    src   "Builds the menu's content on demand -- UMG's OnGetUserMenuContentEvent.\n\nSingle-cast, as UMG's is and as it has to be: two handlers would both build a menu and only one\nof them could be shown, which is a leak with a coin toss in front of it."
    text  "按需构建菜单内容——即 UMG 的 OnGetUserMenuContentEvent。\n\n单播，与 UMG 的该事件一样，也只能如此：两个处理程序都会构建一个菜单，而只有其中一个\n能显示出来，这会造成泄漏，并且还得靠抛硬币来决定。"
    state machine
}

